WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Hello, I’m [name unclear], vice president of SIGS.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.160
Happy New Year to each of you in advance.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.420
I wanted to invite you all to UCI’s Nowruz program

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.760
on March 22 at the Student Center.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.600
A wonderful evening with traditional dance and music,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.120
and K-von will perform standup comedy.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.700
An after-party with DJ Mohsen and DJ [name unclear].

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.820
If you haven’t got your tickets, tickets are limited.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.120
Get them. I hope to see each of you.
